Z||000009||Cheever2||12-12-2000||07:23 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 286SE'S:<BR><B>But the picture is of a white 84 and he is selling a red 86.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>No, you misunderstood... the picure of the white one was what I got from inquiring into a <B>similar</B> ad, which was this one... <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=508982022" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=508982022</A> <BR>I was saying how the ads sounded very similar, and it goes without saying that the sellers are reluctant to give out information.  This one apparently sold, to someone who surely didn't get any more info than I did, and the car was in San Antonio.  The car in the ad in the post above is in New York.<P>Editing to say I just sent the New York seller an email requesting more info.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 12-12-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||Cheever2||12-13-2000||06:04 PM||||<B>I received the following email:</B><BR>Yes, you were right the air bag is on the passenger side and only the door <BR>locks are electric.  It was an error in writing......  Yes, Mint condition it <BR>was garage kept and mileage is original, price is negotiatable --- are you <BR>still interested and were you able to see a color pic on e-bay as we did have <BR>problems transfering it.<BR><B>And I have sent back this reply:</B><BR>No photos yet on eBay that I can tell.<BR>I'll try to verify, but my understanding is that no Fieros ever came from the factory with airbags, regardless whether driver or passenger side.<BR>And it's not for me, but I discuss Fiero stuff with people on the Internet, and one of them brought it to my attention.  I may be of some help finding a buyer if I can provide them with more information and/or pictures.  You may be aware, however, that at this time of year there are a lot of Fieros for sale - must have something to do with the weather.<BR>||||reg||6
